# =============================================================================
# dsu_exclusions.tcl - coverage waivers for the DSU (GENERATED, do not edit:
#     python3 tools/cov/gen_imc_exclusions.py dsu
# from tb/dsu/cov/dsu_waivers.toml, whose entries carry the evidence: PROVEN
# properties, literal RTL lines; see tools/cov/cov_report.py and handbook H5).
#
# Applied in IMC after loading the merged DSU run, e.g.
#     imc -load <cov_work>/scope/all -init flow/cov/dsu_exclusions.tcl
# Instances are written from the DUT top (dsu_top);
# flow/cov/dsu_report.tcl maps that top onto the simulation's instance path.
# Commented lines need IMC's
# block / expression / bin identifiers and are completed in IMC.
# =============================================================================
